@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Get All Categories
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Category by ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/categories/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a New Category
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Footwear & Boots",
  "description": "Tactical boots, waterproof trail shoes, and rugged socks."
}

### 4. Update a Category
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryName": "Tactical & EDC Gear",
  "description": "Everyday carry essentials, multi-tools, tactical pens, and compact survival gear."
}

### 5. Get All Products (Paged & Filtered)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=12&sortBy=newest
Accept: application/json

### 6. Search Products by Name
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products?search=Titanium
Accept: application/json

### 7. Filter Products by Category
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products?categoryId=1
Accept: application/json

### 8. Filter Products by Price Range & In Stock
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products?minPrice=20&maxPrice=50&inStockOnly=true
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Featured Products
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/featured?limit=6
Accept: application/json

### 10. Get Product by ID
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 11. Create a New Product
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Tactical Quick-Release Belt",
  "description": "Heavy-duty military nylon webbing belt with solid zinc alloy cobra-style buckle.",
  "price": 18.50,
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1624222247344-550fb60583dc?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
  "stockQuantity": 30,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 12. Update Product
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Titanium EDC Pocket Multi-Tool (Gen 2)",
  "description": "Upgraded Grade 5 titanium pocket multi-tool with 16 tools.",
  "price": 39.99,
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1588854337221-4cf9fa96059c?w=800&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
  "stockQuantity": 20,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 13. Update Product Stock Quantity (PATCH)
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockQuantity": 15
}

### 14. Delete Product
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json
